{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Vzx3KRaJSg523DyGRYrkm7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp_022_seed789 | 3rd seed SciERC inference (seed=789) with ft_002_v2 (Qwen3-8B). N=8, T=1.0, joint NER+RE, logprobs collected. Complements seed42 (exp_012_rerun_1024) and seed123/456 for multi-seed analysis. | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp_020_fewnerd_smoke | 1-epoch LoRA (r16) fine-tune Qwen3-8B on Few-NERD INTRA coarse 8-type (131k train), then N=8 T=1.0 pilot inference on 200 test instances. Re-started training 2026-05-16 18:29 CST on cuda:1, PID 288683. ETA ~22:55 CST. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_023_lora_rank8** (success): —\\\\n- **exp_vc_lp_cascade_selection** (killed): VC-filtered LP selection cascade: test if combining VC (pre-filter) + LP (rank) improves selection F1 over single-signal selection. Addresses SF3 reviewer suggestion. Pure analysis on existing data.\\\\n- **exp_tacred_re_benchmark** (killed): TACRED RE benchmark: replicate SciERC RE experiment flow on second RE dataset. Verify correlation-selection gap generalizes beyond SciERC. D104 highest priority — addresses R11 MF1 consensus weakness.\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 62 / 负向 24 / 失败 4 / 共 112\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nautodl-5090: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- ft_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pilot_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_007_ner_llama: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp001_seed123: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp001_seed456: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp008_re_n16: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_002_merge_conll2003: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_