{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HWiywf2WpfcjjaZ4NiY2er","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 117\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP 方案: ACE05 上验证 structural consistency vs Fleiss'' Kappa 的 correlation\\\\n    差异'\\\\n  rationale: 'PMC12888769 用 surface-level Fleiss'' Kappa 在 zero-shot 模型上得到 ρ=0.20-0.28，我们假设\\\\n    fine-tuned 模型 + structural consistency (soft Jaccard) 能达到 ρ≥0.40。这是整个论文的基础假设——如果\\\\n    structural consistency 不能更好地预测准确率，后续的 adaptive gating 无从谈起。Phase 0 pilot 设计: Qwen3-8B\\\\n    fine-tuned on ACE05, N=8 samples, 200 instances, 对比两种 consistency metric 的 Spearman\\\\n    ρ。Pass ≥0.40, Fail <0.30。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 审查意见，收紧 MVP pass/fail 标准\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 指出 5 个问题，全部合理采纳：(1) PASS 必须要求 EAE (high-headroom subtask) ρ≥0.40，仅\\\\n    NER 通过不够（ceiling effect 可能虚高）；(2) MARGINAL 区间加 time-boxed protocol: N=16 追加 +\\\\n    1天上限；(3) 加 fine-tuning 质量门控 (NER≥73, EAE≥45)，模型不行时先修 fine-tuning；(4) ACE05 今天必须确认；(5)\\\\n    监控 T=1.0 per-sample F1 分布，>30% F1=0 时追加 T=0.7。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: SciERC RE 替代 ACE05 EAE 作为 MVP high-headroom subtask\\\\n  rationale: ACE05 需 LDC 许可，用户未确认。SciERC 公开可得，有 NER+RE 两个 subtask。RE base F1 ~47（与\\\\n    ACE05 EAE ~52 相当），结构复杂度高（entity pair + relation type），headroom 大，是 EAE 的合理替代。PASS\\\\n    标准更新为 RE ρ≥0.40。需要补实现 RE 的 consistency + evaluation + pipeline 支持。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 07:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Gate 0: NER PASS (60.4%), RE FAIL (33.8%). 执行方案 C——当前模型先跑 pilot + 追训改进版，需修复\\\\n    RE evaluation'\\\\n  rationale: RE 33.8% 低于 40% 阈值但不阻塞 pilot：(1) headroom 大，oracle best-of-N 有提升空间；(2)\\\\n    consistency correlation 不要求高绝对 F1，要求 per-instance variance；(3) 弱模型上验证假设结论更强。但\\\\n    Reviewer 发现两个评估缺陷必须先修：(a) 28% test instances 无 gold relations，会在 (consistency=1.0,\\\\n    F1=0) 处制造 artifact，必须排除；(b) 需报告 full ρ 和 conditional ρ（排除 all-samples-F1=0 的 instances），隔离\\\\n    knowledge-gap cluster 的稀释效应。方向反转是系统性错误（consistent wrongness），恰好对应 error taxonomy\\\\n    中的 \\\\\\\"systematic errors\\\\\\\" 类别——本身是有价值的分析数据点。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ft_001\\\\n    role: gate0_eval\\\\n    result: NER 60.4% PASS, RE 33.8% FAIL\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 07:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP pilot ft_001 结果：FAIL but positive signals. 等 ft_002 结果再做最终判定。\\\\n  rationale: ft_001 pilot 核心数据：RE ρ_sj_full=0.254 (FAIL <0.40), NER ρ_sj=0.362 (接近)。但\\\\n    conditional ρ（排除 knowledge-gap instances 后）显示正面信号：RE conditional ρ_sj=0.352 >\\\\n    ρ_fk=0.311 (Δ=+0.041)，NER conditional ρ_sj=0.369 > ρ_fk=0.357。核心假设\\\\\\\"structural\\\\n    > surface\\\\\\\"在控制 knowledge-gap 后成立。Oracle headroom 极大 (NER +16.9pp, RE +21.7pp)，TTS\\\\n    有巨大潜力。ft_002 (LoRA r=32, 5 epochs) 正在训练，如果 RE F1 提升到 ≥40%，knowledge-gap 减少可能将\\\\n    ρ_sj 推过 0.40。Parse failures 偏高，ft_002 pilot 需增加 max_tokens。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ft_001\\\\n    role: mvp_pilot\\\\n    result: 'FAIL: RE ρ_sj_full=0.254, NER ρ_sj=0.362. Conditional: RE 0.352, NER\\\\n      0.369. Oracle headroom: RE +21.7pp, NER +16.9pp'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: Narrative 选择方案 A (stay-the-course)：等 ft_002_v2 改进 RE 后重跑 pilot，保留强 claim\\\\n  rationale: ft_001 pilot FAIL (RE full ρ_sj=0.254 <0.30)，但诊断结论是模型 RE 质量不足而非假设方向错误。证据：(1)\\\\n    NER 方向全面正确 (SJ>FK, ρ=0.362)；(2) RE conditional ρ=0.352 进入 MARGINAL 且 SJ>FK (+0.041)；(3)\\\\n    58.3% RE samples F1=0 是 knowledge-gap 噪声淹没信号。ft_002_v2 (LoRA r=32, 5 epochs, 降\\\\n    batch + gradient checkpointing 防 OOM) 预期 RE F1 提升到 ≥40%，减少 knowledge-gap instances，将\\\\n    ρ 推向 0.40。成本仅 ~2h (训练 30min + pilot 60min)。如果 ft_002_v2 也不过，conditional ρ 分析作为\\\\n    fallback analytical contribution。不选 B (NER-only 太弱) 或 C (纯 conditional 有 cherry-picking\\\\n    风险)。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_001\\\\n    role: pilot\\\\n    result: 'FAIL: RE full ρ=0.254, cond ρ=0.352; NER ρ=0.362'\\\\n  - exp_id: ft_002\\\\n    role: retrain\\\\n    result: OOM at step 73, restarting as ft_002_v2\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: Gate 1 FAIL (RE rho_sj=0.244<0.30), 但 T=1.0 zero rate 44%>30% 触发协议内 T=0.7\\\\n    追加，暂不 pivot\\\\n  rationale: 1) RE full rho_sj=0.244 < 0.30 触发 ROADMAP FAIL 路径；2) 但 44.3% RE F1=0\\\\n    > 30% 阈值，按 Gate 1 设计追加 T=0.7 实验——这是协议预设步骤不是补救；3) RE cond rho_sj=0.316 > 0.30 说明排除\\\\n    all-zero 后进入 MARGINAL 区间，SJ 在\\\\\\\"可做\\\\\\\"实例上仍有信号；4) NER rho_sj=0.383 稳定正面；5) SJ vs FK\\\\n    翻转值得关注但可能与高 zero rate 有关，T=0.7 可能改善。最终 pivot 决策等 T=0.7 结果。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_004\\\\n    role: Gate 1 pilot (ft_002_v2)\\\\n    result: RE rho_sj=0.244 FAIL, NER rho_sj=0.383 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_003\\\\n    role: Gate 1 pilot (ft_001) baseline\\\\n    result: RE rho_sj=0.237, NER rho_sj=0.381\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: E1 否定乘性惩罚假设，Narrative B 排除，确认走 Narrative A (NER-primary + RE diagnostic)\\\\n  rationale: E1 component-wise 分析：head_sj ρ=0.210 远低于 NER ρ=0.383（差 17pp），所有单组件 ρ\\\\n    都低于组合 SJ（0.244），加法/乘法聚合几乎相同（0.243 vs 0.244）。结论：RE consistency 信号本质弱于 NER，是复合错误传播的固有属性，不是\\\\n    metric 设计问题。Narrative B（度量分解修复 RE）不可行。Narrative A（NER 为主 + RE \\\\n\\\\n... [截断: 省略 83825 字符，传 max_chars=0 获取完整内容]\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 88825, \\\"truncated\\\": true}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XwiP9E8yHrwSW4dSMLkQ4B","session_id":"6d14e849-04d8-4a95-8f72-941f894ab1f4","uuid":"5f4dccd0-84da-4397-a234-3789a072c676","timestamp":"2026-05-16T12:04:36.984Z"}
